NSS-accelerated SQM for the 11.4 NSS firmware line (the 802.11s mesh offload
builds). Same features and tuning as nss-edma.qos: physical WAN port as the
SQM interface, gross L2 rates, `option igs_upload` per-port upload isolation,
and the strict-priority DSCP fast lane (`ip dscp set <class> meta priority
set 100:0`, both directions, `option fastlane '0'` to disable). ECN settings
are ignored on 11.4 too. Requires an image built with NSS_FIRMWARE_VERSION_11_4
(the NSS qdisc module then speaks the 11.4 per-node statistics format).
